---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Taylormade Brands"
  description="How Taylormade Brands collects, uses, and protects information on this website."
>
  <main>
    <section class="section legal-page">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow dark">Privacy</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how Taylormade Brands ("we," "us") collects and uses information
          when you visit taylormadegrowth.com or contact us through this site.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Information you provide.</strong> When you submit the contact form or the growth
            assessment, we collect the details you enter — such as your name, business name, email,
            phone number, and anything you tell us about your business.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Usage information.</strong> With your consent, we use analytics and advertising
            cookies to understand how visitors use the site and how well our ads perform. This may
            include pages viewed, general location, device type, and how you arrived at the site.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your inquiry and provide the services you request.</li>
          <li>To follow up about your project or the growth assessment you submitted.</li>
          <li>To improve the website and measure the performance of our marketing and ads.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics and Google Ads to measure site traffic and advertising results.
          These tools may set cookies. When you first visit, you can choose to accept or decline
          these cookies using the banner shown on the site. If you decline, analytics and advertising
          cookies are not used. You can also clear cookies at any time in your browser settings.
        </p>

        <h2>Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal information. We share information only with service providers
          that help us run the site and our marketing — including Netlify (website hosting and form
          delivery) and Google (analytics and advertising) — and only as needed to provide those services.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You may decline analytics and advertising cookies using the consent banner. To ask what
          information we have about you, or to request that we delete it, contact us using the details below.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Taylormade Brands<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:josh@taylormadegrowth.com">josh@taylormadegrowth.com</a><br />
          Phone: <a href="tel:+13343916641">334-391-6641</a>
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a
          new "last updated" date.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    .legal-page h2 {
      margin-top: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      color: var(--navy);
    }
    .legal-page p,
    .legal-page li {
      color: var(--gray);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .legal-page ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .legal-page li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .legal-updated {
      color: var(--gray);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .legal-page a {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</Base>
